<title>USA: Holly Products holders OK reverse split.</title>
<headline>Holly Products holders OK reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>BALA CYNWYD, Pa. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holly Products Inc said Tuesday a majority of its shareholders had ratified several company proposals, including a one-for-10 reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The shareholders also approved changing the name of the company to Holly Holdings Inc and increasing the number of authorized shares of common stock to 150 million from 50 million.</p>
</text>
